    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n13742" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀποσκώπτω</span></b> , <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>banter, rally,</i>
			
